<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Brewery six-month net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Brewery six-month net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited six-month results of Ceylon Brewery Ltd for the period ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>			 6 months 1996	 6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    604.76	vs	404.26</p>
<p>    Net profit	   32.66	vs	  5.59</p>
<p>    Tax provision	17.50	vs	  2.800</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Brewery is Sri Lanka's main brewer. Apart from its own portfolio of brands, the company also brews Carlsberg and Guinness under license. Ceylon Brewery's performance received a shot in the arm from a drastic cut in excise duty on beer in the 1996 budget presented in November 1995.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
